msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "Eksempler:"

#. TRANSLATOR: group_edit.mako, advice to user about policies
msgid "A liaison psychiatry department might operate in a mental health environment using idnum1, and an acute hospital environment using idnum2. It might want to allow uploads using either ID number, for quick access to the CamCOPS server version from the acute hospital environment, but require idnum1 to be present before the data can be finalized. It also wants full identification with forename, surname, DOB, and sex. It could use an upload policy of <code>forename AND surname AND dob AND sex AND (idnum1 OR idnum2)</code> and a finalize policy of <code>forename AND surname AND dob AND sex AND idnum1</code>."
msgstr "En kontakt psykiatri afdeling kan operere i en mental sundhed miljø ved hjælp af idnum1, og et akut hospital miljø ved hjælp af idnum2. Det kan være en god ide at tillade uploads ved hjælp af enten ID-nummer, for hurtig adgang til CamCOPS-Server versionen fra det akutte hospitalsmiljø, men kræve, at idnum1 er til stede, før dataene kan færdiggøres. Det ønsker også fuld identifikation med fornavn, efter navn, DOB, og køn. Sig kunne hjælp en sende politik i <code>forename AND surname AND dob AND sex AND (idnum1 OR idnum2)</code> og en afslutte politik i <code>forename AND surname AND dob AND sex AND idnum1</code> ."

#. TRANSLATOR: group_edit.mako, advice to user about policies
msgid "In contrast, a research environment might want no patient-identifying information, and a single research pseudonym for that study. It might use an upload and a finalize policy that are both <code>sex AND idnum1</code>."
msgstr "I modsætning hertil vil et forskningsmiljø måske ikke have nogen patient identificerende information og et enkelt forsknings pseudonym for den undersøgelse. Det kan bruge en upload og en færdig politik, der er begge dele <code>sex AND idnum1</code> ."

